(7248842, 1124863, 152252, '<td valign="top">Your image has this really cool feel to it. I fell in love with it the moment I saw it.  <br/>I agree with what <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=23484" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bmartuch</a> said.<br/>Ah... and I think it looks great with that border. Well done!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-08-08 01:12:06.</i></td>', 'Your image has this really cool feel to it. I fell in love with it the moment I saw it.  I agree with what  bmartuch said.Ah... and I think it looks great with that border. Well done!', '2014-08-08 02:11:24.000000', '2014-08-08 02:12:06.000000', 0),
(7248843, 1125645, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on another blue, and another PB! And another wonderful shot! Those gorgeous horses are doing you proud.</td>', 'Congratulations on another blue, and another PB! And another wonderful shot! Those gorgeous horses are doing you proud.', '2014-08-08 02:11:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7248847, 1125696, 16046, '<td valign="top">under rated</td>', 'under rated', '2014-08-08 02:35:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7248853, 1125645, 115814, '<td valign="top">Well, this has been an amazing week for me. Two blues in a row. Two PB''s in a row (both over seven). I''m now officially ready for a string of sub-six entries. <br/> <br/>Thank you to all who voted and commented. I''m really pleased with the outcome.<br/> <br/>Although I believe I''ve been improving as a photographer since registering here in 2010, the majestic subject matter of these wonderful animals (and some really nice glass) makes this accomplishment easier than hunting down the perfect challenge content. It was a glorious morning at the <a href="//www.returntofreedom.org/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Return to Freedom Wild Horse Sanctuary</a> in Lompoc, California. An experience I''ll never forget. Anyone traveling to Santa Barbara County (2 hours north of Los Angeles) needs to be sure this place in on their "must see" list. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-08-08 02:04:43.</i></td>', 'Well, this has been an amazing week for me. Two blues in a row. Two PB''s in a row (both over seven). I''m now officially ready for a string of sub-six entries.  Thank you to all who voted and commented. I''m really pleased with the outcome. Although I believe I''ve been improving as a photographer since registering here in 2010, the majestic subject matter of these wonderful animals (and some really nice glass) makes this accomplishment easier than hunting down the perfect challenge content. It was a glorious morning at the Return to Freedom Wild Horse Sanctuary in Lompoc, California. An experience I''ll never forget. Anyone traveling to Santa Barbara County (2 hours north of Los Angeles) needs to be sure this place in on their "must see" list. ', '2014-08-08 03:02:39.000000', '2014-08-08 03:04:43.000000', 0),
(7248860, 1125645, 135744, '<td valign="top">What an utterly superb photo!! Congrats on the blue</td>', 'What an utterly superb photo!! Congrats on the blue', '2014-08-08 03:21:30.000000', NULL, 0),
