(7249086, 1125954, 58430, '<td valign="top">This is sublime.  WOW.</td>', 'This is sublime.  WOW.', '2014-08-08 13:22:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7249091, 1124384, 147314, '<td valign="top">I had a long look at this one and hesitated about the score I would give you. For me the big problem were the two blown out areas on the left side, my eyes kept going there instead of to the bird. I decided on a 5 at last, but with another crop without those white areas it would have been an easy 6. Hope this helps.</td>', 'I had a long look at this one and hesitated about the score I would give you. For me the big problem were the two blown out areas on the left side, my eyes kept going there instead of to the bird. I decided on a 5 at last, but with another crop without those white areas it would have been an easy 6. Hope this helps.', '2014-08-08 13:39:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7249103, 1124384, 19944, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kroburg:</b></div><hr/><i> I had a long look at this one and hesitated about the score I would give you. For me the big problem were the two blown out areas on the left side, my eyes kept going there instead of to the bird. I decided on a 5 at last, but with another crop without those white areas it would have been an easy 6. Hope this helps. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Use your hand to cover the bright area, and you just get a really boring loon on the pond.  To me, the bright spots <i>made</i> the photo.</td>', 'Originally posted by Kroburg: I had a long look at this one and hesitated about the score I would give you. For me the big problem were the two blown out areas on the left side, my eyes kept going there instead of to the bird. I decided on a 5 at last, but with another crop without those white areas it would have been an easy 6. Hope this helps.   Use your hand to cover the bright area, and you just get a really boring loon on the pond.  To me, the bright spots made the photo.', '2014-08-08 13:53:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7249110, 1124384, 54446, '<td valign="top">Bright areas represent areas of lost detail due to being blown out glare.  Also, detail lost in the shadows, as it is mostly a silhouette.    The composition is awkward and leaves the viewer in a quandary as to where to focus attention.  I continue to look for something interesting to view in the scene, but come up empty.  The score is a gift.  I didn''t vote in this FS challenge.</td>', 'Bright areas represent areas of lost detail due to being blown out glare.  Also, detail lost in the shadows, as it is mostly a silhouette.    The composition is awkward and leaves the viewer in a quandary as to where to focus attention.  I continue to look for something interesting to view in the scene, but come up empty.  The score is a gift.  I didn''t vote in this FS challenge.', '2014-08-08 14:00:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7249134, 1125645, 96751, '<td valign="top">Look at you all over the fp!!!!  Congrats on the blue in the FS!!!!</td>', 'Look at you all over the fp!!!!  Congrats on the blue in the FS!!!!', '2014-08-08 14:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
