(7249189, 1125716, 30861, '<td valign="top">SAo this was you! I gave it a 9, and well deserved at that. Had the bit of pavement not been there, I bet I''d have tenned it :-)</td>', 'SAo this was you! I gave it a 9, and well deserved at that. Had the bit of pavement not been there, I bet I''d have tenned it :-)', '2014-08-08 16:34:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7249190, 1125718, 102278, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Robski:</b></div><hr/><i> looks like the cathedral at liverpool ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It is indeed.</td>', 'Originally posted by Robski: looks like the cathedral at liverpool ?   It is indeed.', '2014-08-08 16:36:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7249192, 1124991, 150277, '<td valign="top">I thought this was adorable, nice catch.  However, the rock was almost more prominent than the animals to my eyes, that took a way a bit from the photo''s impact IMHO.  My eyes kept moving back to that darker rock.  I scored this a 6 - it was a very good image, but just didn''t have quite the power a few of the others did for me.</td>', 'I thought this was adorable, nice catch.  However, the rock was almost more prominent than the animals to my eyes, that took a way a bit from the photo''s impact IMHO.  My eyes kept moving back to that darker rock.  I scored this a 6 - it was a very good image, but just didn''t have quite the power a few of the others did for me.', '2014-08-08 16:45:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7249215, 1124991, 114225, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6, which is often my "average" vote in a free study.<br/> <br/>It didn''t come out and grab me, I think due to the composition. That rock takes up about 40% of the photo, and the critters only about 20%. This gives the boring rock a lot of prominence. Maybe some tighter cropping would have helped.</td>', 'I gave this a 6, which is often my "average" vote in a free study. It didn''t come out and grab me, I think due to the composition. That rock takes up about 40% of the photo, and the critters only about 20%. This gives the boring rock a lot of prominence. Maybe some tighter cropping would have helped.', '2014-08-08 17:05:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7249236, 1124384, 58667, '<td valign="top">I think a 6 is fairly good. But the world is going to end; you have blown out areas. Personally, I like the composition. Maybe for a photo like this, a portrait crop would work better, but I''m no expert to say. As far as story and emotion go, there isn''t all that much, however it does leave room for some (again, in my personal view). I would probably have voted 6, maybe 7, depending on the time of day, the position of the moon, sunspots, etc.</td>', 'I think a 6 is fairly good. But the world is going to end; you have blown out areas. Personally, I like the composition. Maybe for a photo like this, a portrait crop would work better, but I''m no expert to say. As far as story and emotion go, there isn''t all that much, however it does leave room for some (again, in my personal view). I would probably have voted 6, maybe 7, depending on the time of day, the position of the moon, sunspots, etc.', '2014-08-08 17:18:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7249251, 1124991, 58634, '<td valign="top">For what it''s worth, my vote was a 7. I thought it to be a good image with good perspective and lighting. I can see what <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114225" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">giantmike</a> is referring to in terms of the composition. Maybe a tighter crop would''ve been better and it would''ve shown us more detail in the actual beavers. <br/> <br/>I still really liked this image especially due to their facial expressions. Very cute.</td>', 'For what it''s worth, my vote was a 7. I thought it to be a good image with good perspective and lighting. I can see what  giantmike is referring to in terms of the composition. Maybe a tighter crop would''ve been better and it would''ve shown us more detail in the actual beavers.  I still really liked this image especially due to their facial expressions. Very cute.', '2014-08-08 17:31:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7249254, 1125729, 58634, '<td valign="top">contrary to what <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=24983" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">kiwinick</a> said, I happen to really enjoy the selective focus. The first word that came to mind when I saw this image was "exquisite" and I''m really shocked that it didn''t do much better. The bright colors are gorgeous.</td>', 'contrary to what  kiwinick said, I happen to really enjoy the selective focus. The first word that came to mind when I saw this image was "exquisite" and I''m really shocked that it didn''t do much better. The bright colors are gorgeous.', '2014-08-08 17:36:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7249258, 1121291, 58634, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks, I was your 9 vote! I found this to be such a fun, and different shot. Very unique and it stood out from the rest IMO.</td>', 'One of my top picks, I was your 9 vote! I found this to be such a fun, and different shot. Very unique and it stood out from the rest IMO.', '2014-08-08 17:37:35.000000', NULL, 0),
