(7249268, 1124285, 58634, '<td valign="top">I connected with this. I found it intriguing as well and all I could think of when I saw this was "OH." and then it left me speechless.</td>', 'I connected with this. I found it intriguing as well and all I could think of when I saw this was "OH." and then it left me speechless.', '2014-08-08 17:43:29.000000', NULL, 0),
