(7249278, 1125314, 58634, '<td valign="top">114th place!? Unbelieveable. I for one loved the movement and processing in your image. I was unable to comment during challenge voting period but I am shocked to see you ended so low. <br/> <br/>Beautiful image.</td>', '114th place!? Unbelieveable. I for one loved the movement and processing in your image. I was unable to comment during challenge voting period but I am shocked to see you ended so low.  Beautiful image.', '2014-08-08 17:48:07.000000', NULL, 0),
