(7249335, 1124384, 28742, '<td valign="top">I liked it - gave it a 6. Had a lot of initial visual impact, but impact declines a little bit when I go into critique mode and start picking it apart. Pretty much all of the things previously mentioned. Tha said, it would have done much better in a topical challenge like maybe "Sunsets &amp; Duck Silhouettes" ;-) As stated, a 6+ in a FS is laudable.</td>', 'I liked it - gave it a 6. Had a lot of initial visual impact, but impact declines a little bit when I go into critique mode and start picking it apart. Pretty much all of the things previously mentioned. Tha said, it would have done much better in a topical challenge like maybe "Sunsets & Duck Silhouettes" ;-) As stated, a 6+ in a FS is laudable.', '2014-08-08 19:17:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7249374, 1124384, 115814, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 6. While I don''t object to strong highlights, I think that two hot spots lined up vertically on the left overpowered the subject. I think I might have tried a tighter crop and cloned out the pinpoint hot spots on the duck''s reflection. I do like the color warmth and overall mood conveyed.</td>', 'I gave it a 6. While I don''t object to strong highlights, I think that two hot spots lined up vertically on the left overpowered the subject. I think I might have tried a tighter crop and cloned out the pinpoint hot spots on the duck''s reflection. I do like the color warmth and overall mood conveyed.', '2014-08-08 21:15:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7249377, 1124991, 115814, '<td valign="top">Yep. I''m going to agree with the prominence of the foreground rock as the detractor for me. I love the expressions, though and gave it a 6.</td>', 'Yep. I''m going to agree with the prominence of the foreground rock as the detractor for me. I love the expressions, though and gave it a 6.', '2014-08-08 21:19:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7249392, 1125645, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light - you caught it just right!  Congratulations on two on the front page with awesome scores at the same time!<br/></td>', 'Gorgeous light - you caught it just right!  Congratulations on two on the front page with awesome scores at the same time!', '2014-08-08 21:49:26.000000', NULL, 0),
