(7249529, 1125291, 159723, '<td valign="top">Hi Robert (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=39184" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">yakatme</a>)! <br/> <br/>Thanks heaps for your support and great advice! I will definitely look into that tutorial and make another attempt at editing my photo. I''ll post an updated version in the commentary field later, if I can get it right. It might take me a little while :)<br/> <br/>BTW your ''I did NOT need this today'' picture is hilarious (and of course also a great shot) :)<br/> <br/>Thanks again,<br/>Arna<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-09-02 07:14:06.</i></td>', 'Hi Robert ( yakatme)!  Thanks heaps for your support and great advice! I will definitely look into that tutorial and make another attempt at editing my photo. I''ll post an updated version in the commentary field later, if I can get it right. It might take me a little while :) BTW your ''I did NOT need this today'' picture is hilarious (and of course also a great shot) :) Thanks again,Arna', '2014-08-09 07:26:12.000000', '2014-09-02 08:14:06.000000', 0),
