(7249879, 1125729, 156466, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=60173" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">aliqui</a> and <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=58634" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Revecca</a>.  The idea was to focus on the dew and not the flower, so I wonder whether <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=24983" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">kiwinick</a> read the title, and if not would that have made a difference.  Funny thing is, this sat at about 6.5 until the last 2 days and then fell like a lead balloon, as did my distortion shot, so there must have been some cranky voters.  LOL</td>', 'Thanks for the comments,  aliqui and  Revecca.  The idea was to focus on the dew and not the flower, so I wonder whether  kiwinick read the title, and if not would that have made a difference.  Funny thing is, this sat at about 6.5 until the last 2 days and then fell like a lead balloon, as did my distortion shot, so there must have been some cranky voters.  LOL', '2014-08-10 15:49:20.000000', NULL, 0),
