(7250584, 1125729, 156466, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Revecca:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by backdoorhippie:</b></div><hr/><i> Thanks for the comments, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=60173" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">aliqui</a> and <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=58634" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Revecca</a>.  The idea was to focus on the dew and not the flower, so I wonder whether <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=24983" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">kiwinick</a> read the title, and if not would that have made a difference.  Funny thing is, this sat at about 6.5 until the last 2 days and then fell like a lead balloon, as did my distortion shot, so there must have been some cranky voters.  LOL </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I commented in the last ten minutes of the challenge and gave you a 9 so I know it wasn''t my fault! LOL. It still shocks me that this dropped as much as you say it did. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What, you couldn''t have given me a 10 to get me over the 6 mark?!  :)  (it would have, btw)</td>', 'Originally posted by Revecca: Originally posted by backdoorhippie: Thanks for the comments,  aliqui and  Revecca.  The idea was to focus on the dew and not the flower, so I wonder whether  kiwinick read the title, and if not would that have made a difference.  Funny thing is, this sat at about 6.5 until the last 2 days and then fell like a lead balloon, as did my distortion shot, so there must have been some cranky voters.  LOL   I commented in the last ten minutes of the challenge and gave you a 9 so I know it wasn''t my fault! LOL. It still shocks me that this dropped as much as you say it did.   What, you couldn''t have given me a 10 to get me over the 6 mark?!  :)  (it would have, btw)', '2014-08-12 10:03:18.000000', NULL, 0),
